OL,3,ADemocratic socialist defeats incumbent
OL,4,AKaren Bass in Los Angeles mayor's race
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer win solidifies that America's two
OL,7,Fbiggest cities will now be led by
OL,8,Fdemocratic socialists, which include
OL,9,Fsome of the most high-profile
OL,10,Fpoliticians in the US, such as Mamdani
OL,11,Fand Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez.
